  "outcome": "deny",
  "rationale": "We recommend denying this claim because the automated findings and claimant's account confirm the vehicle was being driven off a maintained public or private road in a field at the time of the collision, which triggers the policy exclusion for off-road use. Clause [BASIC-4.7] governs this exclusion.",
  "citations": [
    {
      "clause_id": "BASIC-4.7",
      "quote": "We do not cover loss that occurs while the covered vehicle is being driven off a maintained public or private road, including on trails, fields, beaches, dunes or other unimproved terrain."
    }
  ]
}
